{{!--
  The scrolling area between the header and the roll log. Every tab renders
  inside it, so the scroll behaviour, padding and safe-area handling are
  written once rather than repeated per section.

  The active tab's template is chosen by the shell and included as a dynamic
  partial. Only the visible tab is built — rendering all of them and hiding the
  inactive ones would mean laying out a full spell list on a phone every time
  someone glances at their skills.

  CONSTRAINT: exactly one top-level element. See the note in header.hbs.
--}}
<div class="phonedry-content" data-scroll data-active-tab="{{tab}}">
  {{> (lookup . "tabTemplate")}}
</div>
